# Stream host test (test/m4/stream.sh): the OPEN seam t0a0c -> t0a0d
# (a1a2, cwg flags 8). New Game on t0a0c; the player stands in the seam's
# approach box looking at the elevator (the carry box), so t0a0d opens
# and its OPEN draw set draws across layers (ren: oseam=).
# Syntax and semantics: docs/formats/route-bytecode.md.
startmap t0a0c
setpos -1100 -1508 40 0 0
wait 3
shot open-seam
stats open-seam
pass
